From 20a609a0f75d62bbf2fd2747a394b9628d973d9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jon Mason <jon.mason@arm.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] rdv3: Wait longer for RSE SYSTOP sync

RSE now finishes provisioning and authenticating its images after the
SCP's 800 ms timeout expires. SCP then asserts even though RSE sends
the expected doorbell shortly afterward. Allow five seconds for the
handshake so the platform can complete boot.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Jon Mason <jon.mason@arm.com>
---
 product/neoverse-rd/rdv3/scp_ramfw/config_scp_platform.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/product/neoverse-rd/rdv3/scp_ramfw/config_scp_platform.c b/product/neoverse-rd/rdv3/scp_ramfw/config_scp_platform.c
--- a/product/neoverse-rd/rdv3/scp_ramfw/config_scp_platform.c
+++ b/product/neoverse-rd/rdv3/scp_ramfw/config_scp_platform.c
@@ -19 +19 @@
-#define RSS_SYNC_WAIT_TIMEOUT_US (800 * 1000)
+#define RSS_SYNC_WAIT_TIMEOUT_US (5 * 1000 * 1000)
